		"body": "`parsedUrl.origin` drops any path segment included in the configured Ollama base URL (e.g. `https://host/ollama`), which changes behavior vs the previous `${baseUrl}/api/chat` concatenation and can break setups behind a reverse proxy path. Also, `new URL(rawUrl)` will throw a generic \"Invalid URL\" error if the value is malformed; consider surfacing a clearer message while still enforcing the protocol check.",
